 ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le11ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Sally:<br><br>\nGina, Tara, Grace and I have read your articles with advice for staying young longer. We've all decided that we've got to quit smoking and we're going to have to be more active."}, {"time": "12000", "image": "engenn6le11ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "We're going to have to cut down on our consumption of sweets too. (Even though we'd prefer to eat those most tempting treats!) We all need to eat a little more sparingly. We'd better start this now before it's too late.To help, we've each chosen one day a week to plan a meal and some light exercise."}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn6le11ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Tara suggested that we might want to get some more sleep. We haven't felt very calm or rested lately! She thinks we should get away from our computers at home more too! Some of us would rather shop that way, so we've thought of having a time limit."}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le11ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "I've downloaded a healthy living app. I'd rather have the information there whenever I need it.\nThanks for the articles. We'll let you know how it goes.<br/> <br/>\nGina, Tara, Grace and Valerie"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Living Longer Better"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Planning for the Future"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le11ob11re1img02.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can offer advice and solutions to people on how to improve their health or longevity. <br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">You should ...</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">You need to ...</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">You ought to ...</span> (strong request) </li><li><span class=\"italic\">You had better ...</span>(strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice and Solutions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>We all need to eat a little more sparingly.</p><p>We'd better start this now before it's too late.</p><p>We also think we might want to get some more sleep.</p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Saying What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you say what is necessary to follow advice, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span>, or <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>. <span class=\"italic\">Have got to</span> focuses on now and in the future. <span class=\"italic\">Going to have to</span> focuses on the future alone. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saying What is Necessary\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>We have got to quit smoking.</p><p>We're going to have to be more active.</p><p>We're going to have to cut down on our consumption of sweets too. </p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to quit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stop going "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She quit smoking last year. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you need to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advice "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an opinion on what someone should do "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What advice can you give me on living a long life? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "active "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "busy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She led a very active life. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "consumption "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the using of goods, like food  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Cut down on red meat consumption. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sparingly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "using very little  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She always eats sparingly. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "schedule "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a notation of times when something is to happen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Make up a sleep schedule. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "calm "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "slow and relaxed  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You feel calm and refreshed after a good night's sleep. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rested "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having energy after relaxation or sleep  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He always feels rested after 8 hours of sleep. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tempting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "attractive; appealing even if not good for you  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those pastries look tempting!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to download"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put into a computer's memory "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I downloaded an app on healthy food choices."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob11aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a letter to comment on a magazine or newspaper article."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what you have read in the article."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what it has made you think about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your letter to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a letter to comment on an article."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I have read."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write what t has made me think about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my letter aloud."}]}]}